   {name, intent} shape working (rows only). Rust ops.rs: allow the {name, from:"read"} shape (exactly those keys).
2. `profiles.accept` (both forms): BEFORE replacing, save the profile being replaced into the ProfileStore as `accepted-before-<UTC yyyymmdd-HHMMSS>` (complete
   profile text as it was; if that name exists add -2, -3). If that save fails, refuse the accept (nothing changed). Return `previous_saved_as`. Audit it.
3. UI (views/profiles.js): "Save current state as…" button (name field, validation ^[a-z0-9._-]{1,64}$) next to the accepted card; it needs a fresh read
